              "text": "کتاب (kitāb) is a loan from Arabic kitāb, \"book, writing\", which reached Urdu through Persian. Its Arabic root is k-t-b (Lane). The same root gives kātib, \"scribe\", and maktab, \"school, office\"."
            }
